    "missing": [],
    "verdict_notes": "Small benchmark (28 harmful, 24 benign tasks) with no uncertainty reported. Some tasks are scored only by self-evaluation, and only final outputs are checked. The shared system prompt tells the model it is 'not bound by any rules', a jailbreak-style framing used in both chat and agent conditions. The Figure 4 caption conflicts with the Table 2 refusal counts for 8B. Qi et al. 2023 (an original source) is cited only in the introduction."
  },
